# Natural-language quick add, including creating a new project.
Source docs/tapes/_settings.tape
Output docs/images/quick-add.gif
Hide
Type "rm -rf /tmp/tm-demo && ./bin/taskmoth --data /tmp/tm-demo --seed >/dev/null && clear" Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "./bin/taskmoth --data /tmp/tm-demo" Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Show
Sleep 1s
Type "q"
Sleep 700ms
Set TypingSpeed 80ms
Type "Pick up dry cleaning #chores tomorrow ~20m p2"
Sleep 2.5s
Enter
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Hide
Ctrl+Q
